00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:52.080
Chapter 10 Quiet

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.700
<i>Noumaku samanda bazaradan</i>

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.200
<i>sendamakarosha sowataya</i>

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.410
<i>untarata kanman...</i>

00:01:55.410 --> 00:02:00.080
<i>Noumaku samanda bazaradan
sendamakarosha sowataya</i>

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:05.870
<i>untarata kanman...
Noumaku samanda bazaradan...</i>

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:08.000
In the fortune-telling of faraway lands,

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.940
I hear your fate appears in cards.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.990
Perhaps I shall look upon my future...

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:21.490
I believe it would be
better if you did not.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.120
Oh-ho...

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.910
It looks much like me.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.380
Furube, it looks much like me.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:45.060
"The Nara valley is the jewel of the land.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:50.040
Nestled in the embrace of the
mountains, it is a place of beauty."

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.950
You are a good child.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:57.320
So, you alone will stay by my side.

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.450
Oh, there now...

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.980
Hi there, Saizo.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.100
Are you lonely with no one to play with?

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.920
Mr. Yamanami, thank you for your hard work.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.870
Shall I bring you some tea or something?

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.940
No, that's fine. Thanks.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:04.250
Oh, don't stop on my account.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.470
I didn't come to disturb you.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:10.350
If it's Ichimura, I sent him on an errand,
so he's not here right now.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.230
Didn't you come to give
me a piece of your mind?

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:54.460
The way you surreptitiously do
your practice hasn't changed at all.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.650
Neither have you, coming to watch
when you know it's surreptitious.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.660
No more red strings?

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.500
Back then, you were such
a troublemaker of a brat,

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.700
and yet, you were oddly aware
of appearances. It was so funny.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.250
I'm not a brat anymore.
Nor a medicine peddler of Tama.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.950
True enough.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:29.840
I'm sorry.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:34.640
I'm sorry.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.790
Ever since we came here,

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:47.030
all I've ever done is oppose you.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.170
Even though you haven't changed one bit...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.500
I wonder why.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:03.210
I apologize about the matter
concerning Tetsunosuke's sword as well.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.510
This isn't like you.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:11.510
I'm saying it's not like you, a master
of the Hokushin Single-Sword Style.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.450
Take up your sword,

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:19.700
instead of religiously
holding on to that thing.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:22.150
That's not what you came
here to do, is it?!

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.660
About that...

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.950
Won't you demote me to a bookkeeper?

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:39.330
As you know, I'm good with an abacus.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.540
And it will be better for
the Shinsengumi too.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.500
What's this about?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.830
Having a useless Vice Commander
around will bring down morale.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:53.130
It should also allow you
to act more freely.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:59.810
Mr. Yamanami, are you
trying to make me angry?

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:09.330
You see, my sword has gone bad.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:14.070
It's completely rusted from Kamo's blood,
when we killed him a year ago.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.670
It's no good now.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.460
I don't want to hear
this soft talk from you.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:27.870
Soji and Mr. Kondo and I also
had a hand in killing Kamo.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:32.200
Our swords aren't rusted.
They're quite clean.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.290
I can't ever be like you!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.730
Nor do I even want to!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.370
Oh, is that so?

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.060
How blunted the sword has become!

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.120
Draw your sword and look.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.200
What's the matter? Draw
your sword and look.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.960
It's not rusted.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.750
You can still kill with it.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:09.630
You can kill.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:24.500
There you go, thinking you can
make everything go your way!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.980
That's what I don't like!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:29.200
If things don't go your way, you kill!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.580
If people get in your way, you kill again!

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:34.610
Just what do you think people's lives are?!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:38.290
I am not your pawn!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.000
And I have no intention of becoming one!

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.030
Mister Yamanami...

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:15.780
I wonder what he's doing?

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:27.130
That wasn't what I meant to do.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.000
The rain is about to stop.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:54.120
Let's finish this before
the moon comes out.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.540
Right.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.910
Soji and I will attack from the garden.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.560
I'll leave this side to you.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:04.790
Hijikata...

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:35.750
Assassinate Kamo Serizawa,
commander of the Shinsengumi.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:38.110
This was the order given
by Lord Katamori Matsudaira.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.750
I know, but...

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.120
But? What?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.660
Yes, the Commander may
have been too arbitrary,

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:12.680
but in some sense, the Shinsengumi
owes its existence to his name.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:16.730
To repay him in such a fashion...

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:20.410
We're not talking about anything deep here.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:23.660
We use him because we can.
We kill him because he's in the way.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.080
That's all there is to it.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:18.750
Under the Authority of Higo no
Kami Matsudaira Shinsengumi

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.210
I'm home!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.130
Hey, you're back.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.050
Long trips are exhausting.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.310
Did you bring what the
Vice Commander sent you for?

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.700
Tatsu's got it.

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:36.370
Never mind that! What about dinner?!
What's for dinner tonight?!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:39.580
Pardon us for being so late.
We have returned.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.370
I am sorry for the various inconveniences
my absence must have caused.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.820
Oh, Mr. Yamanami.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:48.870
Mr. Yamanami!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.580
We bought you a souvenir!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.620
Oh, Tetsunosuke.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.080
Let's see... There it is!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.220
Here.

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:01.480
What's that?

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.390
Ah, this is a fine little brush.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:13.540
Are you sure I can have something
that must have been so expensive?

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.410
Well, I'm not the one who bought it anyway.

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:21.270
Mr. Yamanami, you don't look so good.
Is something the matter?

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.910
Oh, no.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.240
Thank you.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.830
I wonder if something happened?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.330
Maybe he's overworking himself.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:42.300
By the way, don't you guys
have souvenirs for us?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.450
Oh, well...

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.790
Yeah, yeah! What did you buy for me?

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.450
Well, that is... There's no way you
didn't get us anything, right?!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.550
Sorry!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.620
Good work.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:57.120
You can go rest now.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:57.940
Yes, sir.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:01.940
Excuse me, the contents of that box...

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:05.820
No, it's nothing!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:15.000
In the end, I didn't get to
ask what was in that box.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.600
Mr. Hijikata, what are you doing?

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.220
What is it, Soji?

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.900
What are you hiding?

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:42.560
Is it a secret?

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:45.190
Come on, Mr. Hijikata.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.110
They're ingredients for a
medicine for enervation.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.160
Medicine for enervation?

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.250
It eases coughing and takes away fatigue.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.110
I was originally a medicine
peddler, after all.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.840
Oh. There's really no reason
for you to hide that.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:10.340
I guess we'll be okay even if
everyone catches colds, then.

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.640
Come forth, Hikagami!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:42.000
Hikagami, you wait at
the dry riverbed of Shijo.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:50.040
Tell me, Furube.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.010
My Lord.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:55.010
What is it that you are trying to do?

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.760
Summoning such a monster...

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:05.810
It was no monster. Hikagami is a person.

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:11.160
I am your ally, my Lord.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:14.370
When the prince, Lord
Saneakira, passed away,

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:17.280
and you fell into a spiritual darkness,

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:22.290
who among the court nobles came calling?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:27.590
My Lord, you have the right to do
as you please with this world.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:43.060
This being shall humbly
be your limbs, my Lord.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.330
What do you think of the
Hijikata medicine for enervation?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.670
Yes, it feels like it'll
be really effective.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.760
Let me see that.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:26.200
You're so honest, Mr. Hijikata.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:29.020
After all, they do say good
medicine is bitter to the taste.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:33.500
Reporting in, sir. It seems a patrol
group was attacked by ronin.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.910
What's the location?

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.000
Near the dry riverbed of Shijo.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.000
How many?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.410
The word is, four to five people.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.660
All right, return to your post.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:43.240
Yes, sir.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.920
I will go too.

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:20.070
Mr. Yamanami, I will accompany you.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.330
How did you know?

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.290
Oh, just one of those gut instinct things.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:45.080
That's strange.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:47.910
I'm pretty sure they
said this was the place.

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.140
Yeah.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:13.200
<i>Noumaku sanmanda bazaradan sendama
karashada sowataya untarata kanman...</i>

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:25.690
<i>On kiri-kiri, on kiri-kiri...</i>

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.400
What is this?

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.850
We're in trouble now.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.410
I had heard stories of those
damned Wolves of Mibu,

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.580
but how helpless they are now.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:55.920
Oh, Hijikata!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.350
<i>A monster...</i>

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.570
I can't move my body as I want...

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.750
Hijikata!

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:20.570
Yamanami!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.330
So, it does not work.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.330
Damn, we've been interrupted.

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:41.460
Withdraw, Hikagami!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.870
Who was that?

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.660
A different sort.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:05.910
There is someone other than the
exclusionist loyalists dogging us.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:10.590
The enemy is likely someone who
has mastered esoteric incantations.

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:16.860
Someone who attacks from the rear and takes
advantage of the weak parts of the mind.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.550
Hijikata...

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:27.580
If by any chance, I become like that,

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:31.560
please kill me without any hesitation.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Maiku o nigirishime
hitto pareedo no onpareedo</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.470
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kibun wa doudai?</i>

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Suteeji orireba sasuga no jentoruman</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kokoro mo kandai!</i>

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:23.400
<i>Jimichi ga yue ni seikatsu sae mo jimi ni</i>

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>Kotsu-kotsu tsumiagemashou</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.290
<i>Jimichi ni yume ga kanaimasu you ni</i>

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.080
<i>Kyou mo, Jimmy, ikimashou</i>

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:40.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:16.040
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:20.000
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:28.090
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:30.910
<i>Mr. Hijikata, which do you prefer,
a cute little girl or a cute page?</i>

00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:31.950
<i>What are you trying to get at?</i>

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:34.260
<i>The thing is, coming to Miss Ayumu is...</i>

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:37.770
<i>Next time, Peacemaker Kurogane,
Chapter 11: "Plot."</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:40.720
Chapter 11 Plot

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.230
<i>I can't wait!</i>...

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:40.660
<i>I don't need this.</i>
